<title>SRI LANKA: Haycarb down 8 pct on retail profit-taking.</title>
<headline>Haycarb down 8 pct on retail profit-taking.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Haycarb Ltd fell 8.33 percent or eight rupees to 88 in early Thursday trade on retail profit-taking, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Small investors are taking profit in haycarb which gained substantially in the recent rally,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Colombo stocks have risen over 20 percent in 1997 due to improved investor sentiment.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
